    "label": "thm:bisection",
    "number": "Theorem 39",
    "quote": "Under \\cref{ass:bisect}, with probability at least $1 - \\delta$, the regret of \\cref{alg:bisection:full} is bounded by $\\Reg_n = O\\left(\\vol(K) + \\sqrt{n \\log\\left(\\frac{n}{\\delta}\\right) \\log(n)}\\right)$."
   },
   "confidence": "high",
   "notes": "vol(K) is the width of the interval K, mapped to diam_K. Algorithm due to Agarwal et al. (AFHKR11)."
  },
